TRAFFIC ADVISORY: EYO FESTIVAL

As Lagos comes alive with the rich traditions of the Eyo Festival, motorists and commuters are advised to plan ahead. Expect road closures and heavy traffic around key routes leading to Lagos Island. Kindly use alternative routes, follow traffic officials’ directives and consider public transportation where possible.

